Since $\lmk \in \partial g(\zk) = \Omega$ and $\lmk\to \olm$ as $k\to\infty$, we arrive at  $\olm\in\Omega =\partial g(\zk)$ for all  $k$ sufficiently large. Fix such a  $k\in \N$ and  deduce from $\olm \in \partial g(\zk)$ that
